From: Avium A16 Reproducer <avium-a16-reproducer@example.invalid>
Date: Mon, 17 Aug 2026 03:28:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wm: host fullscreen tasks keep the drag-restore protocol

The window-state bridge only handled FREEFORM host tasks, so entering fullscreen through the caption fullscreen button left the HWC without MAXIMIZED state: dragging the top white strip only moved the window and never restored it to a freeform window with the window bar.

Treat FULLSCREEN-mode host tasks like maximized tasks in the bridge: publish MAXIMIZED on fullscreen entry (with saved freeform bounds), and on NORMAL from the strip drag, move the task back to FREEFORM with restored bounds before acking. Host xdg geometry stays authoritative and the desk-less default display is preserved.

Change-Id: If2b345be9d30e2d42d4bc3bfac592ffb944ba626
---
 .../desktopmode/DesktopTasksController.kt     | 30 ++++++++
 .../WaydroidTaskWindowStateBridge.kt          | 72 +++++++++++++++++--
 2 files changed, 97 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/DesktopTasksController.kt b/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/DesktopTasksController.kt
index ac9be19c8950..fa3fbf4780c0 100644
--- a/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/DesktopTasksController.kt
+++ b/libs/WindowManager/Shell/src/com/android/wm/shell/desktopmode/DesktopTasksController.kt
@@ -6456,6 +6456,36 @@ class DesktopTasksController(
         )
     }
 
+    /**
+     * Restores a Waydroid host task that is currently in fullscreen mode back
+     * to a freeform window.  The host compositor/HWC is the geometry
+     * authority for host windows, so this mirrors the fullscreen entry
+     * transition: switch the task's windowing mode back to FREEFORM and apply
+     * the restored bounds in one transaction (the desk-less default display
+     * has no desk to route through, so the desktop-mode restore helpers are
+     * not usable here).
+     */
+    fun restoreWaydroidHostTaskFromFullscreen(
+        taskInfo: RunningTaskInfo,
+        restoreBounds: Rect,
+    ) {
+        logV(
+            "restoreWaydroidHostTaskFromFullscreen taskId=%d restoreBounds=%s",
+            taskInfo.taskId,
+            restoreBounds,
+        )
+        val wct = WindowContainerTransaction()
+        wct.setWindowingMode(taskInfo.token, WINDOWING_MODE_FREEFORM)
+        if (!restoreBounds.isEmpty) {
+            wct.setBounds(taskInfo.token, restoreBounds)
+        }
+        transitions.startTransition(
+            TRANSIT_CHANGE,
+            wct,
+            windowDragTransitionHandler,
+        )
+    }
+
     /** Called when a task's info changes. */
     fun onTaskInfoChanged(taskInfo: RunningTaskInfo) {
         if (!DesktopModeFlags.ENABLE_FULLY_IMMERSIVE_IN_DESKTOP.isTrue) return
